.TH BLACKJAK 6.SH NAMEblackjak \- Las Vegas blackjack.SH SYNOPSIS\fBblackjak\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONBlackjack against the dealer.  It offers the rules, gives you a stake ofchips, and for each hand asks your bet, deals two cards -- shown asrank and suit,\fB9S QH\fR-- with their total and the dealer's up card, and asks\fBHit (H) or Stick (S)?\fRuntil you stand or go over 21..SH FILES.TP 12\fB/dd/GAMES/SNOBOL/PHRASE.SYN\fRthe phrases it talks in..SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fROne of Robert Heller's programs translated from SNOBOL4 into C, fromJames F. Gimpel's\fIAlgorithms in SNOBOL4\fR;\fR\fBDOC/snobol\fRdescribes the set and\fBSRC/effo_snobol\fRholds the source..SH SEE ALSOpoker, bjack